274@P8: Los Angeles Office\nL275@P8: 12424 Wilshire Blvd., Suite 1400\nL276@P8: Los Angeles CA 90025\nL277@P8: Contract duration\nL278@P8: The present contract will run from the sign of the contract until 02/14/2025.\nL279@P8: There will be no tacit renewal of this contract.\nL280@P8: We make payment via ACH. Please provide the Company's ACH Routing number and account number\nL281@P8: so that our payments can be properly credited.\nL282@P8: Please note that our office is part of the official Mission of Italy to the United States and is exempt from\nL283@P8: paving tax on purchases over $ 325.00.\nL284@P8: For our administrative purposes, please include our Purchase Order number on all correspondence\nL285@P8: and invoices concerning this order.\nL286@P8: ITA reserves the right to increase or decrease the contractual amount by a maximum of 20% as\nL287@P8: needed, without any further obligation toward the Company.\nL288@P8: Social Media Contents creation, before, during and after the event, to promote the Italian\nL289@P8: companies’ delegation and encourage attendance. Graphics provided by ITA. Delivery: 1\nL290@P8: week from ITA’s materials provision.\nL291@P8: Recalls and RSVP updated on a weekly basis, with a weekly follow-up to the ITA team.\nL292@P8: Production of n.1 promotional video clip (max 1 minute), focused on the Italian Life Sciences\nL293@P8: industry and the Italian companies’ delegation (materials provided by ITA). Delivery: 1 week\nL294@P8: from ITA’s materials provision.\nL295@P8: Assistance during the event to facilitate media relations and connect US journalists with\nL296@P8: Italian representatives. At least 2 people are required.\nL297@P8: Final report of the activities carried out, including the final list of attendees, complete of their\nL298@P8: contact information.\nL299@P8: Terms of Payment\nL300@P8: Payment will be issued upon completion of the service and at the receipt of the original invoice,\nL301@P8: addressed to the attention of:\