 protect whistleblowers who report or disclose information on breaches of the law observed in\nL334@P9: the context of their work-related activities. The reports,which are kept fully confidential, are managed\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn7view3 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7674-Exhibit-AB-20251205-0.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7518-Exhibit-AB-20251212-5.pdf)\nciteturn7view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 19; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7518-Exhibit-AB-20251212-5.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 544\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7522-Exhibit-AB-20250117-1.pdf)\nciteturn7view5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 12; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7522-Exhibit-AB-20250117-1.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 287\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7683-Exhibit-AB-20251231-1.pdf)\nciteturn7view6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 9; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7683-Exhibit-AB-20251231-1.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 210\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7609-Exhibit-AB-20250609-1.pdf)\nciteturn7view7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: application/pdf; Number of pages: 14; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://efile.fara.gov/docs/7609-Exhibit-AB-20250609-1.pdf\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 407\n--------------------------------------------------